{"type":"standard","title":"Stephanie Bice","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Stephanie Bice</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q60190894","titles":{"canonical":"Stephanie_Bice","normalized":"Stephanie Bice","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Stephanie Bice</span></span>"},"pageid":59501728,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Rep._Stephanie_Bice%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Rep._Stephanie_Bice%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":438},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Rep._Stephanie_Bice%2C_117th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1136,"height":1508},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1373242353","tid":"1671042f-a89e-11f1-bdc7-fac4b88e6f90","timestamp":"2026-09-04T20:20:36Z","description":"American politician (born 1973)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephanie_Bice","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephanie_Bice?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephanie_Bice?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Stephanie_Bice"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephanie_Bice","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Stephanie_Bice","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephanie_Bice?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Stephanie_Bice"}},"extract":"Stephanie Irene Bice is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Oklahoma's 5th congressional district since 2021. She is the first American of Iranian descent to be elected to Congress. A member of the Republican Party, Bice previously represented the 22nd district in the Oklahoma Senate from 2014 to 2020.","extract_html":"<p><b>Stephanie Irene Bice</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Oklahoma's 5th congressional district since 2021. She is the first American of Iranian descent to be elected to Congress. A member of the Republican Party, Bice previously represented the 22nd district in the Oklahoma Senate from 2014 to 2020.</p>"}